  "agent_output": "**Reasoning**\n\n1. **Identify all acquisitions** \u2013 I listed the acquisition names in the database.\n2. **Get the internal IDs** for each acquisition.\n3. **Get the category ID** for \u201cUndeveloped Land\u201d.\n4. **Retrieve the allocation amount** for \u201cUndeveloped Land\u201d for every acquisition that has it.\n5. **Retrieve the total assets acquired** for each acquisition (metric name: \u201ctotal assets acquired\u201d).\n6. **Sum** all undeveloped\u2011land allocations and **sum** all total\u2011asset amounts.\n7. **Compute**  \n\\[\n\\text{Percentage} = \\frac{\\text{Total undeveloped\u2011land allocation}}{\\text{Total assets acquired}} \\times 100\n\\]\n8. **Round** to one decimal place.\n\n**Data collected**\n\n| Acquisition | Total assets acquired ($) | Undeveloped land allocation ($) |\n|-------------|---------------------------|---------------------------------|\n| Bremner Healthcare Real Estate | 47.1\u202fM | 0 |\n| Mark Winkler Portfolio | 166\u202fM | 166\u202fM |\n| Savannah Industrial Portfolio | 89.7\u202fM | 60\u202fM |\n| Houston Land & Storage Bundle | 89.7\u202fM | 34.3\u202fM |\n| Midwest Office Complex | (not in narrative, allocation 0) | 0 |\n\n- Sum of total assets acquired = **463.5\u202fM**  \n- Sum of undeveloped\u2011land allocations = **260.3\u202fM**\n\n**Calculation**\n\n\\[\n\\frac{260.3}{463.5} \\times 100 = 56.2\\%\n\\]\n\n**Answer**\n\n56.2%",
